      "citation": "Larsson SC, Orsini N, Wolk A. Body mass index and pancreatic cancer risk: a meta-analysis of prospective studies. Int J Cancer. 2007;120(9):1993-1998",
      "doi": "10.1002/ijc.22535",
      "notes": "RR 1.12 (1.06-1.17) per 5 kg/m2 (2012 update: 1.10, 1.07-1.14); curve compounds the per-5-unit estimate."
    },
    {
      "factorId": "family_history_pancreatic",
